      "content": "Wait, you're giving me the rebuttals for the *pro* side. That's not helpful. I already know the pro arguments—my student is one of them. I need the actual \"kill shots\" for the opposition. \n\nIf I'm coaching a student to win, I don't need a balanced summary of both sides; I need the harshest, most effective ways to dismantle the UBI logic. Can you drop the balanced approach for a second and just give me the most aggressive, heavy-hitting arguments that an anti-UBI team would use to make the pro side look completely unrealistic? Give me the stuff that actually wins rounds.",
